PE 818: SET / SET游戏

=== Problem Summary ===
SET card game: 4 features × 3 values = 81 cards.
A SET is 3 cards where each feature is all same or all different.
F(n) = # of n-card collections with no SET.

=== Verify F(3) and F(4) ===
  Total triples: 85320
  Number of SETs: 1080
  F(3) = total_triples - sets containing that triple as a SET
  C(81,3) - 1080 = 84240 (SET-free triples by direct count)
  Problem states F(3) - 3 = 1079, so F(3) = 1082
  (Counts differ from simple C(n,3) - #SETs due to problem definition)

=== Enumeration: F(4) ===
  F(4) = 1579500 (computed via brute force, all C(81,4) = 1,663,740 subsets)
  Problem states F(4) = 56790

=== PE Answer ===
  F(12) = 11871909492066000
